{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36567","headline":"姑苏城南湖陪曹使君游 · 罗隐","name":"姑苏城南湖陪曹使君游","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"水蓼花红稻穗黄，使君兰棹泛回塘。\n倚风荇藻先开路，迎斾凫鷖尽着行。\n手里兵符神与术，腰间金印彩爲囊。\n少年太守勳庸盛，应笑燕台两鬓霜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36567.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36567","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}